=========================================

MODULE 13-mod-1: Context Engineering & Compression
Maximizing context window efficiency, memory architectures (episodic, semantic, procedural), and context pruning.

Topics:
- Context Construction & Memory Architecture: Anatomy of a Context Window (System, History, Retrieval, Tools, Output), Retrieval-Augmented Generation as Context Construction, Chunking Strategies and Their Impact on Context Quality, Memory Architectures (short-term, episodic, semantic, procedural), Tool Results and Structured Data as Context, Context Compression and Pruning (LLMLingua, RECOMP), Multi-Turn Conversation State and Context Accumulation

MODULE 13-mod-2: Harness Engineering & Sandbox Execution
Building evaluation harnesses, Inspect AI task scorers, E2B/Docker code execution sandboxes, and ReAct loop safeguards.

Topics:
- Evaluation Harnesses & Benchmarking: What is Harness Engineering?, Evaluation Harness Fundamentals (what evals are, why ad-hoc testing fails), LLM Benchmarking with lm-evaluation-harness (MMLU, GSM8K, TruthfulQA), Agent-Native Eval with Inspect AI (Task, Solver, Scorer abstractions), LLM-as-a-Judge Pipelines (model-graded scoring, calibration, bias mitigation)
- Execution Sandboxes & ReAct Safeguards: Tool Execution Sandboxes (E2B, Modal, Docker — secure code execution), Agent State Management & Checkpointing (LangGraph persistence, interrupts), ReAct Loop Harness Patterns (iteration guards, fallback handlers, token budgets), Multi-Agent Execution Harnesses (supervisor-worker contracts)


=========================================
14 — LLMOPS & OBSERVABILITY
=========================================

MODULE 14-mod-1: Tracing, Evals, Cost & Caching
Production observability, cost optimization, token budget enforcement, and semantic caching.

Topics:
- Tracing & Evaluation Frameworks: LangSmith tracing & span telemetry, Langfuse for token & latency monitoring, Logfire span-level traces, RAGAS & Inspect AI evals for RAG & Agent validation
- Cost Control & Caching Strategies: Prompt caching mechanics (Anthropic / OpenAI prompt prefix caching), Semantic caching with Redis / GPTCache, Token accounting, rate limiting, & financial budget enforcement


=========================================
15 — PRODUCTION INFRASTRUCTURE & CLOUD DEPLOYMENT
=========================================

MODULE 15-mod-1: Inference Serving & Cloud Orchestration
Deploying high-throughput model endpoints on AWS EKS, GCP Cloud Run, and Kubernetes clusters.

Topics:
- Inference Engines & Serving Architecture: vLLM, SGLang, & llama.cpp serving engines, Multi-adapter serving (dynamic LoRA loading at runtime), Speculative decoding acceleration, Quantized inference execution (GGUF, AWQ, GPTQ)
- Cloud & Kubernetes Orchestration: AWS EKS, ECR, Batch, ECS Fargate infrastructure, Kubernetes + Helm charts deployment recipes, GitHub Actions CI/CD pipelines for AI applications, Docker & multi-stage container builds for lightweight images


=========================================
16 — AI SECURITY, GUARDRAILS & RBAC
=========================================

MODULE 16-mod-1: Guardrails, LLM Gateways & RBAC Security
Securing AI applications against prompt injection, data poisoning, PII leaks, and unauthorized document access.

Topics:
- Guardrails & Defense Mechanisms: Prompt Injection Defense (Direct & Indirect attacks), Jailbreak Prevention & PII Filtering, Toxicity Filtering & Output Validation, NVIDIA NeMo Guardrails (Colang-based programmable rails), LlamaFirewall — Meta's open-source firewall, LLM Guard — Input/output scanner library, AWS Bedrock Guardrails, Microsoft Presidio — PII detection & redaction
- LLM Gateways & Routing: Load Balancing & Automatic Retries, Metadata, Observability & Caching at Gateway layer, LiteLLM Proxy & AWS Bedrock routing
- Evaluation & RBAC in AI Systems: Evaluation for RAG Systems & Agents under security stress, Identity & Authentication Fundamentals, SAML Assertion Anatomy, JWT as the RBAC Carrier, Retrieval-Layer RBAC (Document-level tenant filtering), Prompt-Layer RBAC (Dynamic System Prompts based on user role), Multi-Tenancy & Data Isolation guarantees


